AI Agent Module
Overview

The AI Agent is the intelligence layer of Wizard. Its primary responsibility is to understand an unknown software repository, determine how it should be executed, verify its behavior, and generate evidence-driven insights without requiring extensive manual intervention.

Instead of relying solely on static code analysis, the AI Agent combines repository understanding, reasoning, execution planning, and verification to produce actionable results.

